{"allowed_english": [], "context": {"approved_glossary_entries": [], "generation_contexts": [{"context_id": "sha256:131629ba968a598d0fb9d6872099617299e7aeffdc6944f901359f06d5abac98", "hash": "sha256:131629ba968a598d0fb9d6872099617299e7aeffdc6944f901359f06d5abac98", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 326089, "byte_start": 325716, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:96d60742d02b893a96d8e9139475a1cab0ec1646baf33ea7df705f88e89cfe13", "line_end": 9007, "line_start": 8997}, "owner_tag": "01VN", "parent_tag": "01VL", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VL", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-ample-very-ample}", "LOCKED_0002": "\\begin{reference}\n\\cite[II, Proposition 4.6.2]{EGA}\n\\end{reference}", "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4ac300b9ef7bcd388afc52a785a4512d682b91b255921bdbf76cf8683c3a27a1", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:bc2cd6432ce4901c1e7c1dd51f5b00fdc526147e5e4511eaad7f4be5a8e32b50", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\n<LOCKED_0002>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an invertible <MATH_0003>-module.\nIf <MATH_0004> is quasi-compact and <MATH_0005> is a relatively\nvery ample invertible sheaf, then <MATH_0006> is a relatively\nample invertible sheaf.\n<STRUCT_0002>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:961b3ecf48f099774e0ecb03ea349efdc150100491eb0f78ca9f2b4e12cc06b1", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:01VN:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:42ea4b7dea48b98e6b94034e2a8cdd0941b3e86bbd602ba7804757f5c37fc974", "hash": "sha256:42ea4b7dea48b98e6b94034e2a8cdd0941b3e86bbd602ba7804757f5c37fc974", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 327465, "byte_start": 327153, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:45d7e382a0d1193231f588fbb2839a5ec1c004c3c0eaa279aab67c929b4362eb", "line_end": 9041, "line_start": 9036}, "owner_tag": "01VL", "parent_tag": "01VL", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "01VL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0002": "$n \\geq 1$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes n}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:60737e3db31d314fd5fbc74c74aec1bede93b5e57feb17873596de96f862d5be", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:37124b41ba926e1564a216160f52f82ddc4c8d0c2c7f417a14291a38c9618668", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nTo arrive at the correct converse of this lemma we ask\nwhether given a relatively ample\ninvertible sheaf <MATH_0001> there exists an integer <MATH_0002> such\nthat <MATH_0003> is relatively very ample? In general this\nis false. There are several things that prevent this from being true:\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:955fea1331fae55d7e2e0364c9c37c8424457bfd20842794253e1d1c3fdc207f", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:01VL:paragraph/0003"}}}, {"context_id": "sha256:8918cdfd1441aa89657b38fc2f28ceb0e74c474d6d2f7f10ee1b64856a54c5ab", "hash": "sha256:8918cdfd1441aa89657b38fc2f28ceb0e74c474d6d2f7f10ee1b64856a54c5ab", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-reference", "location": {"byte_end": 314196, "byte_start": 312886, "file": "morphisms.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:24bebb71803415f1e24df62d44fb58a7aee1b43f00948267a0fa031b97155dda", "line_end": 8713, "line_start": 8679}, "owner_tag": "01VJ", "parent_tag": "01VG", "requested_label": "morphisms-lemma-characterize-relatively-ample", "requested_tag": "01VJ", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01VG", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-characterize-relatively-ample}", "LOCKED_0002": "\\begin{reference}\n\\cite[II, Proposition 4.6.3]{EGA}\n\\end{reference}", "MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{L}$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$S = \\bigcup V_i$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{L}|_{f^{-1}(V_i)}$", "MATH_0008": "$f^{-1}(V_i) \\to V_i$", "MATH_0009": "$S = \\bigcup V_i$", "MATH_0010": "$\\mathcal{L}|_{f^{-1}(V_i)}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{O}_S$", "MATH_0012": "$\\mathcal{A}$", "MATH_0013": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0014": "$\\psi : f^*\\mathcal{A} \\to \\bigoplus_{d \\geq 0} \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d}$", "MATH_0015": "$U(\\psi) = X$", "MATH_0016": "$$\nr_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi} :\nX\n\\longrightarrow\n\\underline{\\text{Proj}}_S(\\mathcal{A})\n$$", "MATH_0017": "$f$", "MATH_0018": "$\\mathcal{A} = f_*(\\bigoplus_{d \\geq 0} \\mathcal{L}^{\\otimes d})$", "MATH_0019": "$\\psi$", "MATH_0020": "$r_{\\mathcal{L}, \\psi}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{constructions-lemma-invertible-map-into-relative-proj}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\item", "STRUCT_0007": "\\item", "STRUCT_0008": "\\item", "STRUCT_0009": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0010": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:d75ab0df8a8cf3f009bc41393b6b8718a672c6a7a47642240a032680586dfaf4", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:796925ed5741ea571f8e5a58fc053d5dd753848021ccd7666d86a65555673850", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\n<LOCKED_0002>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a quasi-compact morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an invertible sheaf on <MATH_0003>.\nThe following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> The invertible sheaf <MATH_0004> is <MATH_0005>-ample.\n<STRUCT_0004> There exists an open covering <MATH_0006>\nsuch that each <MATH_0007> is ample\nrelative to <MATH_0008>.\n<STRUCT_0005> There exists an affine open covering <MATH_0009>\nsuch that each <MATH_0010> is ample.\n<STRUCT_0006> There exists a quasi-coherent graded <MATH_0011>-algebra\n<MATH_0012> and a map of graded <MATH_0013>-algebras\n<MATH_0014>\nsuch that <MATH_0015> and\n<MATH_0016>\nis an open immersion (see Constructions, Lemma\n<REF_0001> for notation).\n<STRUCT_0007> The morphism <MATH_0017> is quasi-separated and\npart (4) above holds with\n<MATH_0018>\nand <MATH_0019> the adjunction mapping.\n<STRUCT_0008> Same as (4) but just requiring <MATH_0020>\nto be an immersion.\n<STRUCT_0009>\n<STRUCT_0010>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:07f2505ec1b3a7d2aedc8b54861eb97ec72e5c5ec7ee13d22378da741b9be467", "unit_id": "inventory:morphisms:01VJ:lemma/0001"}}}], "input_freeze": {"hash": "sha256:722732d0f19852f75e6efdac5ce92bb6a852c9d613d7f03d57f712de37ab02f9", "path": "translation-data/source-adoption-inputs/p1-29-morphisms-d019.json"}, "model_output": {"hash": "sha256:461e154f4a981c16d2e429e4df80ec1a2716ab1652c08b8094adbf6a47420af6", "path": "docs/evidence/p1-29-morphisms-d019-raw-01.jsonl", "record_hash": "sha256:60749043be9bf75554d16be74f84f2c12b1d1295c8d8cd922cbbc1b60d43dd65"}, "neighbor_unit_ids": [], "policy_revision": "git:b753f6444727f8fc4aa34d05b8523e6abff18b21", "prior_generations": [], "prompt_version": "translator-v2", "source_adoption_id": "p1-29-morphisms-d019", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "style_guide_path": "config/style-guide.md", "turn_id": "01a21dda-16ef-7401-a4aa-34784c86d5a0", "unit_id": "tag:01VN:proof"},