phism）<MATH_0015>（与此映射（map）相联系）恰为浸入（immersion）<MATH_0016>这一步。\n因此，由引理（Lemma）<REF_0001>的第（6）部分即得结论。\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:d0edb94e3929d347156df72293274e2d07a146a0d40878cae66bd8bdaec931a9", "unit_id": "tag:01VN:proof", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "修饰所取的模", "source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"context": "在给定环层上的模", "source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"context": "给定基底上的浸入", "source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"context": "修饰所构造的代数", "source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"context": "在给定环层上的分次代数", "source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"context": "分次代数所带的映射", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "所给映射表达式中的第二个箭头", "source_term": "arrow", "target_term": "箭头"}, {"context": "第二个箭头用到的等同", "source_term": "identification", "target_term": "等同"}, {"context": "用于得到态射的伴随关系", "source_term": "adjointness", "target_term": "伴随性"}, {"context": "由伴随性得到的态射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "与所述映射相联系的态射", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "确定所述态射的映射", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "验证中与所述态射相等的浸入", "source_term": "immersion", "target_term": "浸入"}, {"context": "引用其第（6）部分的引理", "source_term": "Lemma", "target_term": "引理"}]}
